{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/extras/32bff6274749c7eac1b80986d3f94b4d.avif?t=1766353718\" width=1560 height=302 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Explore</strong> a charming world that slowly reveals its darker side as you move forward.<br>Face enemies, defeat challenging bosses, copy their abilities,<br>and follow a path that grows ever deeper into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/extras/f75d4b02ea72ad688ece6373e6fa1331.avif?t=1766353718\" width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <i>Metroidvania-<strong>lite</strong></i> with <i>Soulslike</i>-<strong>inspired</strong> combat,<br>where striking at the right moment is the key to victory \u2014<br>the more anxious you are, the harder the journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/extras/a7ca6d53d1bc2e2218e6c35f5845758b.avif?t=1766353718\" width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss you defeat grants you a new power. <br>Grow stronger and stronger until you uncover\u00a0the<br>truth behind this world and defeat the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993350/extras/61a1021a24fb4c32b5772d84a18af38e.avif?t=1766353718\" width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loreninha</strong> falls asleep and awakens in a world of vibrant dreams,<br>now being consumed by an ever-growing darkness.<br>But perhaps it\u2019s not just a dream...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The first of many","path":"https: